# Trivy suppressions — every entry needs a justification.
# DS-0002 (run as non-root USER): this stack runs under rootless podman, where
# container root maps to the host user. Host bind mounts (~/.secrets GPG keyring,
# ~/.gnupg, e2e ./.tmp/data) are only accessible to that mapped root; switching the
# image to a non-root USER makes them unreadable and breaks the worker + e2e smoke
# test. Mitigations: single-user box behind tailscale, app bound to 127.0.0.1,
# secrets mounted read-only, no other workloads share the containers.
DS-0002
